{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-hostile-species","chapterId":"handbook-monster-4034013","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"codex-hostile-species-handbook-monster-4034013-handbook-monster-4034013-0","text":"伴随黑潮而来、狩猎泰坦火种的无名剑士，无人知晓其真身。\n身负不可思议的力量，剑技也近乎无懈可击。疯狂与执着交织于它的锋刃，神悟树庭与哀丽秘榭皆毁于其手。","speaker":""}]}
